      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we want the place to be more explicit that it\u0027s in a VM if it also selects the namespace. I assume you could use rpc binder and not be in microdroid? I think apexd has a flag along the lines of --vm-mode, so it would be nice if we started to have a convention.",
