      "writtenOn": "2021-07-16T14:16:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was trying to be consistent with Victor\u0027s use of rpc_binder for this (e.g. http://cs/android/packages/modules/Virtualization/compos/src/compsvc.rs?l\u003d154\u0026rcl\u003de3a1124650a2d9f4724458596822fe38cbffe8b2) - mainly because that\u0027s where I lifted a lot of this code from.\n\nIn theory you can use RPC binder \u0026 not a vsock, but only vsock is exposed to Rust at the moment (via RunRpcServer / RpcClient).\n\nWe\u0027ll need to remove the usage of the Odsign namespace at some point (which only works anyway if you run as root).",
